<title>UK: Premier Funding sets $300 mln asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Premier Funding sets $300 mln asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche</p>
<p>asset-backed floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager</p>
<p>Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PREMIER FUNDING INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    12.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
